EvrenOzsan","id":65464767,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NDY0NzY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65464767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan","html_url":"https://github.com/AltayEvrenOzsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AltayEvrenOzsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T21:19:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T21:19:31Z","body":"heya, thanks for the guidance! I moved the math constants directly into the tex_blit.glsl file instead. I found that canvas.glsl was doing the same thing, (just hardcoding #define M_PI right in the GLSL) so I followed that pattern here.\r\n\r\nIs this the right approach, or if there's a different place these constants should live? It's my first time diving deep into the engine, so let me know if i missed something! ^^\"\"","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4185245841/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187510777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118163#issuecomment-4187510777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/